From 7566589a133a0728a17f2d414e14428de4ee1787 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fxzx micah <48860358+fxzxmicah@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:32:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] device: Store route preferences per profile device

Route save flags describe selections for individual profile devices, not
a complete snapshot of their preferences. Store each explicit request
under its profile and device key instead of replacing a profile-wide list.

Update each preference directly from the saved Route parameter and let
State coalesce writes. Track active routes per logical device so devices
sharing one route receive independent property restoration. Automatic
fallback and property restoration do not overwrite stored preferences.

Separate read-only lookup from EnumRoute updates. Refresh membership and
priority, replace records when indices are reused, and reject stale named
route parameters instead of resolving them to a different route. Stop
pending enumeration work when the route-state policy is disabled.
